# React history routes.
# Contact is one React app for both sites, hosted on icue.vn (contact-app in the
# vn repo, built to /contact). ?site=en keeps the page in English and sends its
# chrome links back to en.icue.vn — same arrangement as Our Work below.
/contact               https://icue.vn/contact?site=en    301
# About Us is now one page for both sites, hosted on icue.vn, which renders all
# six UI languages — same arrangement as Contact above and Our Work below.
# ?site=en selects English and sends its chrome links back to en.icue.vn.
# The `!` is required here and not on the two neighbours: about-us.html is still
# produced by this build, and without it Netlify serves that file instead of
# following the redirect. Drop the `!` once the page stops being built.
/about-us              https://icue.vn/about-us?site=en   301!
# Our Work is one React app for both sites, hosted on icue.vn. ?site=en keeps
# the page in English and sends its chrome links back to en.icue.vn.
/our-work              https://icue.vn/our-work?site=en   301
/past-projects         /past-projects.html          200
# FAQs and Recruitment are single apps for both sites now, hosted on icue.vn
# (faq-app and recruitment-app in the vn repo), each rendering all six UI
# languages. ?site=en selects English and points their chrome back here.
# Forced with `!` on purpose. This build no longer produces recruitment.html or
# faqs.html — routeMeta.js stopped listing them — but it did until this change,
# so a copy left in a cached or previously-published deploy would win over an
# unforced 301 and quietly keep serving the retired English page.
/recruitment           https://icue.vn/recruitment?site=en  301!
/news-archive          /news-archive.html           200
/notable-awards        /notable-awards.html         200
# Community Activities is a single app for both sites now, hosted on icue.vn
# (community-activities-app in the vn repo), rendering all six UI languages.
# ?site=en selects English and points its chrome back here. Forced with `!` on
# purpose: a cached community-activities.html from an older deploy would win
# over an unforced 301 and quietly keep serving the retired English page.
/community-activities  https://icue.vn/community-activities?site=en 301!
/faqs                  https://icue.vn/faqs?site=en         301!

